    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/2025f1ad72ee2638e4f043e07595a2ba.avif?t=1755539130\" width=601 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sex &amp; Coffee</strong> \u2615\ufe0f\ud83e\udd0e is an adult visual novel about romance, freshly brewed coffee, magic, and temptation in a modern fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where goblins are TikTok influencers, trolls sell ice cream, and fairies drive taxis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/d7144b0a5bcf19679624ad3074c970ec.avif?t=1755539130\" width=601 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re new barista at a cozy coffee shop that\u2019s become the go-to spot for people seeking more than just the perfect cup of coffee \u2014 they come here for connection.<strong> But there\u2019s a catch:</strong> the shop is on the brink of shutting down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/9176625a45f08da0ecdea59eeee4fb05.avif?t=1755539130\" width=601 height=287 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/323400bf38344ff9c6cc04dd92caa9a4.poster.avif?t=1755539130\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/323400bf38344ff9c6cc04dd92caa9a4.webm?t=1755539130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/323400bf38344ff9c6cc04dd92caa9a4.mp4?t=1755539130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll meet key characters like:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isla, the free-spirited elf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shaya, the badass orc financial analyst</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonya, the cute bunny cop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beata, the mysterious demon writer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/281fce094b1edb13ba5352ee5b95ef56.avif?t=1755539130\" width=601 height=155 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/6a473c356e5ae6969babb7666cba3f1a.avif?t=1755539130\" width=600 height=303 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/7f56701f899f408b625e747405a353f1.poster.avif?t=1755539130\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/7f56701f899f408b625e747405a353f1.webm?t=1755539130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/7f56701f899f408b625e747405a353f1.mp4?t=1755539130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to you to save it by mastering the art of coffee and winning over the hearts of the locals. Get to know your enchanting customers \u2014 each with their own baggage and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset