discover their stories, and spread the word about your coffee shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive content:</strong> Unlock steamy and intimate moments with the characters as your relationships evolve.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/0be18ebf808ce2226e547ff7dfdbd98e.poster.avif?t=1755539130\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/0be18ebf808ce2226e547ff7dfdbd98e.webm?t=1755539130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/0be18ebf808ce2226e547ff7dfdbd98e.mp4?t=1755539130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Sex &amp; Coffee</strong> \u2615\ufe0f\ud83e\udd0e isn\u2019t just about brewing drinks \u2014 it\u2019s about brewing love, magic, and temptation in every cup. Your choices will shape the future of the coffee shop and the fiery connections you build along the way. So, who\u2019s ready for a refill?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
